<title>HUNGARY: Skala H1 after-tax profit HUF 159.5 mln.</title>
<headline>Skala H1 after-tax profit HUF 159.5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-June 1997   Jan-June 1996</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	116.6	vs    150.0</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	  195.2	vs    134.4</p>
<p>    Group after-tax profit	159.5	vs    115.4</p>
<p>    Group net sales	     4,900.2	vs  4,823.4</p>
<p>    Group other revenue	   372.9	vs    323.4</p>
<p>    Material expenditures     3,348.5	vs  3,220.6</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures	702.7	vs    658.4</p>
<p>    Depreciation		    205.2	vs    189.6</p>
<p>    Other costs		     401.3	vs    513.8</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	    498.7	vs    416.5</p>
<p>    Net financial income	   77.7 loss vs     40.6 loss</p>
<p>     Financial revenue	    131.5	vs    285.3</p>
<p>     Financial expenditure	209.2	vs    325.9</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income    156.3 profit vs   24.8 loss</p>
<p>     Extraordinary revenue	206.8	vs     49.2</p>
<p>     Extraordinary expend.	 50.5	vs     24.4</p>
<p>    Taxation			   35.7	vs     18.9</p>
<p>NOTE - Skala-Coop Rt is a trading group. The figures are consolidated, unaudited and were calculated in accordance with Hungarian Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
